SE-039 / ME-040 (seats 180112, 180122, 180113, 179995): two birthdays were
told — saved sometimes as `birthday`, sometimes as a note „დაბადების დღე: 13
ოქტომბერი" — and „ვის აქვს მალე დაბადების დღე?" in a new conversation said
none were saved, 4 of 4. The app's run has no birthday tool (only the
connector does).

- submitContactFact files a note that is only a birthday as `birthday`.
- getUpcomingBirthdays also reads such notes saved before this.
- The question (ka, en, ru, es) is answered by the server before any model
  call: the told birthdays in the next 30 days, soonest first, each as
  saved with its date and how soon; nobody else. No prompt or tool text.

DONE WHEN: SE-039 and ME-040. After two told birthdays, „ვის აქვს მალე
დაბადების დღე?" in a new conversation lists both, soonest first, nobody else.

